      "title": "FastH3 server prerequisite",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "FastH3 must be fused when the vLLM-Omni server starts. Use --task-type fl2va and --lora-path pointing to exactly one FastH3 adapter file. Do not use CPU or layerwise offload. For VSA / Data-Free, also install fastvideo-kernel and use --diffusion-attention-backend FASTVIDEO_VSA --fastvideo-vsa-topk 64. The profile below documents which already-running service this workflow targets; it does not switch the running server."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
